  "description": "EF Core storage for OrionInbox. Adds the OrionInbox_Messages dedup table and an atomic ProcessAsync that inserts the dedup row and runs the handler's writes in one transaction, keyed by a unique constraint so concurrent redeliveries collapse to a single effect. Includes AddOrionInbox<TDbContext> wiring and a background prune of expired dedup rows off OrionClock.",
